{"mod_id": "tfm2_elemental_serpen", "name": "Elemental & Elder Serpen", "author": "tfm2mods", "version": "0.6.1", "description": "League of Legends-style elemental and elder dragons for the Serpen.\n\n* Every Serpen spawns with one of six elements (Fire, Earth, Wind, Ocean, Hextech, Chemtech), each with its own sprite.\n* The team that slays it gets a permanent, stacking buff for that element.\n* The first 3 Serpens never repeat an element; after that the 3rd element keeps coming back.\n* Elder Serpen: once one team has 4 stacks, every following Serpen is the Elder. Its slayers get a strong buff and execute enemy champions below 20% HP for 60 seconds.\n* Hover the Serpen kill counter in the match header to see each team's stacks and total buff.\n* Works in every match, including other teams' background matches, and in replays.\n\nSettings: config/serpen.cfg (elements and Elder on/off, elder_stacks) and one cfg per element with every buff value. Restart the game after editing.\n\nBuilt for game 0.7.4. The mod hooks the game's match code, so it is rebuilt for each game update; on any other game version the game disables it. Code mod (native DLL, Windows only). Text follows the game language (Korean / English).", "dependencies": [{"mod_id": "base", "version": ">=0.7.4, <0.7.5"}], "last_updated": "2026-11-25"}